# Dev server only. "demo" (the default for `npm run dev`): in-memory demo data, no backend needed.
# "http": the real API through the Vite proxy (/v1 -> EDISC_API_ORIGIN); open http://<tenant>.edisc.localhost:5173.
# A production build always uses the real API and FAILS if this is "demo".
VITE_API_MODE=demo
